abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow for comparing cadmium-uptake gene neighborhoods in
  Enterobacteriaceae. Three entries support reference-figure reproduction,
  reconstruction with curated annotations, and automatic target discovery from
  genome annotations, using BEDTools, BLAST, MAFFT and IQ-TREE. Bundled inputs
  include FASTA/GFF data for 29 assemblies. Original project code, configuration,
  tests and documentation are licensed under MIT. Bundled input data retain
  their original source terms and are not relicensed under MIT. Bundled fonts
  retain the SIL Open Font License.
license: MIT
